# Sales: customer, sales_order, sales_order_item, invoice, warranty, return_request, refund
# Use cases: Manage customers, Create sales order, View customer purchase history, Check warranty status,
# Create return request, Approve refund requests, Process approved refund, View outstanding invoices
@url = {{$dotenv SUPABASE_URL}}
@key = {{$dotenv SUPABASE_ANON_KEY}}
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 0) Sign in first (click "Send Request" here) – the other requests use this token
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
apikey: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_PASSWORD}}" }

### 1) All customers
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/customer?order=customer_id
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2) Sales orders with customer, cashier and discount
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/sales_order?select=order_id,order_date,subtotal,discount_amount,total_amount,status,customer(name),user(name),discount(discount_code)&order=order_id.desc&limit=10
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) One sales order with its items and product names
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/sales_order?select=*,sales_order_item(quantity,unit_price,subtotal,product(product_name))&order_id=eq.1
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Purchase history of customer 1
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/sales_order?select=order_id,order_date,total_amount,status&customer_id=eq.1&order=order_date.desc
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Outstanding (unpaid) invoices, oldest due date first
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/invoice?status=eq.Unpaid&order=due_date
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6) Warranties with the sold item and product
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/warranty?select=*,sales_order_item(order_id,product(product_name))&order=warranty_id&limit=10
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7) Return requests waiting for approval
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/return_request?select=*,product(product_name)&status=eq.Pending
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8) Refunds
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/refund?select=*,return_request(reason,status)
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8a) Invoice history – every invoice, newest first, with its payments
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/invoice?select=*,payment(payment_date,receipt_no,method,amount)&order=invoice_id.desc
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8b) One invoice with its sales order, items and customer (invoice details)
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/invoice?select=*,sales_order(order_date,total_amount,customer(name,phone),sales_order_item(quantity,unit_price,subtotal,product(product_name)))&invoice_id=eq.1
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9) CREATE a test customer
POST {{url}}/rest/v1/customer
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Prefer: return=representation

{ "name": "API Test Customer", "phone": "0700000000", "email": "apitest@gmail.com", "address": "Colombo", "registered_date": "2026-11-06" }

### 10) READ the test customer
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/customer?name=eq.API Test Customer
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11) UPDATE the test customer address
PATCH {{url}}/rest/v1/customer?name=eq.API Test Customer
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Prefer: return=representation

{ "address": "Kandy" }

### 12) DELETE the test customer
DELETE {{url}}/rest/v1/customer?name=eq.API Test Customer
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
